<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Just for Tonight</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Rocco</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Skin &amp; Bone</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">3f2MxvJB9kQYSJFADpwE0A</ttm:item><itunes:duration>02:43.000</itunes:duration></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:03.080" end="00:07.910">Picked you out of the crowded room</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:07.910" end="00:14.240">Nothing like I've ever seen before</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.240" end="00:18.360">Said you're not looking for something serious</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.360" end="00:24.790">I can understand if we were just holding hands</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.790" end="00:27.370">If it's just for tonight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.370" end="00:33.960">Tell me you love me and I'll say it too</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.960" end="00:38.500">Baby tell me what this means in the end</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.500" end="00:46.500">If I never see you again again again again again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.640" end="01:13.490">We could do anything</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.490" end="01:21.490">Just wake me up before you have to go before you go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.130" end="01:25.030">All my friends say different things</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.030" end="01:29.830">Telling me everything I already know</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.830" end="01:33.250">I already know</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.250" end="01:36.010">If it's just for tonight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.010" end="01:42.330">Tell me you love me and I'll say it too</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.330" end="01:47.070">Baby tell me what this means in the end</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.070" end="01:51.070">If I never see you again again again again again</p></div></body></tt>